################################################################################
# TEST SUMMARY
################################################################################

# Total Test Cases: 44
#
# Levels API: 18 tests
# ␀ Read operations: 5 tests (GET all, filter by unit, with questions, GET by ID)
# ␀ Create operations: 6 tests (Teacher, Center, Agency, validation errors, unauthorized)
# ␀ Update operations: 4 tests (Teacher, Center, Agency, not found)
# ␀ Delete operations: 3 tests (Agency only, forbidden for Teacher and Center)
#
# Questions API: 18 tests
# ␀ Read operations: 3 tests (GET all, filter by level, GET by ID with answers)
# ␀ Create operations: 7 tests (4 question types + validation/authorization errors)
# ␀ Update operations: 4 tests (Teacher, Center, Agency, not found)
# ␀ Delete operations: 4 tests (Agency only, forbidden for Teacher/Center, not found)
#
# Integration Tests: 4 tests
# ␀ Full workflow: Create level ’ Create questions ’ Get level with questions
#
# Auth Tests: 4 tests
# ␀ No auth, Invalid token for both Levels and Questions
#
################################################################################
# TESTING INSTRUCTIONS
################################################################################

# 1. Start NestJS server: npm run start:dev
# 2. Login with all 4 roles using api-tests/auth.http:
#    - Agency (super admin)
#    - Center (organization admin)
#    - Teacher (instructor)
#    - Student (learner)
# 3. Copy tokens to @variables section at top
# 4. Run tests sequentially to verify:
#     Role-based access control works correctly
#     Validation catches errors
#     Progress tracking integrates properly (levels)
#     Nested answer options work correctly (questions)
#     All 4 question types can be created
# 5. Check Swagger docs: http://localhost:3000/api/docs
#
# Expected Results:
# - Students can only READ levels and questions
# - Teachers can CREATE and UPDATE
# - Centers can CREATE and UPDATE
# - Only AGENCY can DELETE
# - All validation errors return 400
# - Authorization errors return 403
# - Not found errors return 404
#
# Question Types Tested:
# 1. select_right_answer - Multiple choice with one correct answer
# 2. fill_in_blank - Fill in missing words
# 3. sort_words - Arrange words in correct order
# 4. talk_to_speech_compare - Speech recognition and comparison
